  storyText: "Soulkiller\n\nIshida leads you to a lab. \"Our engineers will copy the fragment using Soulkiller. Then the shard - and your part in this - is over.\"\n\nMirage, panicking: \"Soulkiller is a cage. Please. Please don't.\"\n\n1. Go through with it.\n2. Hesitate."
